# --- Reference material, not ours to redistribute -------------------------
*.pdf
!docs/*.pdf
# Escape the brackets. Unescaped, "[Wiley Finance Series]*" is a character
# class: it matches any filename starting with one of W,i,l,e,y,F,n,a,c,S,r,s
# or a space, which silently excluded README.md, implied_volatility.py,
# monte_carlo.py, results/, reports/ and notebooks/ from the repository.
\[Wiley Finance Series\]*

# --- Python ---------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
env/

# --- Jupyter --------------------------------------------------------------
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# --- Editors / OS ---------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# --- Notes ----------------------------------------------------------------
# data/, figures/ and results/ ARE tracked on purpose. The cached price file makes
# the project reproducible without network access, and the committed figures and
# CSVs are the record the supervisor reviews against the submitted reports.
